===Etymology===
Via other European languages, ultimately from {{uder|lv|la|philosophia}}, from {{uder|lv|grc|φιλοσοφία}}, from {{m|grc|φίλος||beloved, friend}} and {{m|grc|σοφία||wisdom}} (with the suffix {{m|grc|-ία}}, {{cog|lv|-ija}}).

